# Calendar UX permanent freeze

See `ops/CALENDAR_UX_PERMANENT_FREEZE.md`.

- Day/week/month layouts, card variants, category rails, all-day row, overlap/+N, portal drawer, soft-keep/transitions, CRUD/Interview ownership, toolbar/tokens are frozen.
- Do not reopen Calendar UX without a new owner wave.
- Do not add post-hire calendar emitters without Wave 2 change-control.
- Do not weaken Interview authority or `calendar.sync` owner-only.
- Populated preview mechanism may exist for canary QA; keep `WATHEFNI_CALENDAR_POPULATED_PREVIEW` **off** for normal production visibility.
